# The divergent join (docs/pageflip.md section 4.3), RIGHT half: it resumes part-way through the
# book, is prompted like the left half, and receives no input at all. The left user confirms, and
# this device seeks to that position and takes its role offset from it.
log pageflip-resume-right: start
expect_timeout 60000
expect Entering activity: Home
wait 800
tap confirm
expect Entering activity: EpubReader
wait 9000
expect positions unrelated
wait 2500
screenshot /screenshots/pf-rs-right-00.bmp
# Driven entirely by the other device's Confirm.
expect reading from the peer's choice
wait 5000
screenshot /screenshots/pf-rs-right-01.bmp
log pageflip-resume-right: done
quit
